{"schema":1,"kind":"decision","id":"01M01EB2JSZ30BBEQ96S2T5E25","title":"Alias the shell tool in the core, not in capability YAML","decision":"Harness shell-tool aliases (Shell, run_terminal_cmd, terminal, ...) resolve to the canonical Bash mapper inside gommage-core (match_tool + shell_candidates), so every tool: Bash mapper covers every harness. Matching only: emits and audit keep the original tool name.","alternatives":[{"option":"Widen each mapper in capabilities.d to tool_pattern with the alias list","why_rejected":"Was applied as a stopgap and verified 12/12, but it only restores proc.exec. shell_candidates stayed gated on tool == Bash, so anchored mappers missed compound commands and cd /r && git reset --hard was allowed under a non-Bash harness while gated under Claude Code. It also has to be repeated in every mapper file and is regenerated away by gommage agent install."},{"option":"Make the evaluator fail open when no capability is derived","why_rejected":"Would turn an unmodelled tool into an unguarded one. The fail-closed posture is correct; the bug was coverage, not the posture."}],"scope":["crates/gommage-core/src/mapper.rs,crates/gommage-core/src/evaluator.rs"],"commits":["23f5b82e259221dd39fb6059c5c8dddfe62a0437"],"author":"codex","confidence":"medium","tags":[],"ts":1786754992729}
